WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Bury an acorn.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.790
Give it soil, rain and time.

3
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.900
It never grows into a pine tree or a rose.

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.170
It grows into an oak.

5
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:14.450
Aristotle, a pupil at Plato's
Academy for about twenty years,

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.200
wanted to know why.

7
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.300
Why does an acorn always become an oak?

8
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:22.530
And is the whole universe
heading somewhere too?

9
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.020
In this mission, you'll learn to ask
four questions about anything at all,

10
00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.330
starting with a bronze statue.

11
00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:34.760
Then you'll meet a mover that keeps the
heavens turning without ever moving itself.

12
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.100
Your mission: explain why an
acorn always becomes an oak,

13
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:42.030
and whether the whole universe
is heading somewhere too.
